# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is in .gitignore.
# Never a real key in a file that does get committed: an RPC key ended up in this
# project's history once and there is no getting it out again.

# A Cronos RPC endpoint. Leave it empty and the public ones in lib/cronos.ts are
# used instead, in order — free, rate-limited, and down often enough that there
# are three of them. A paid provider's URL carries its key, which makes the URL
# itself a secret: in production this is `wrangler secret put CRONOS_RPC`, never
# a var in wrangler.jsonc.
CRONOS_RPC=
